story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Howard County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids July to August and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 61% of normal in November to December and 139% in April to May. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 49% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 17243 had its driest year in 1963, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
